{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜樓宇維修改革措施(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-02-13-35-37qy0pMtNJ.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：樓宇維修改革措施</p><p>政府成立樓宇維修支援及服務局，預料每單收費數千元，如何釐定標準？修訂建築物條例亦針對工程業界醜聞，如何落實有關措施？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>香港建造商會會長廖聖鵬</p><p>立法會議員(工程界)卜國明</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:01:26.917312+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.664980+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:59:03.281232+00:00","content_hash":"32c4dd06abe69289d0cee1ac85f2f411a8eaec22e7f0633661c6cbaa7fd756b8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:01:26.917312+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}